 <h3><u>Binte zahra ka khula sar hai</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Khuda khair kare..(7)<br> Binte zahra ka khula sar hai, khuda khair kare..(3)<br> Binte zahra ka khula sar hai, khuda khair kare..(2)<br> Aur har haath mein patthar hai, khuda khair kare<br> Binte zahra...</p> 
  <p>1. Hurr ke bete pe hi shabbir bohot roye the..(2)<br> haye, ab to laashe ali akbar hai, khuda khair kare</p> 
  <p>2. Maarte hai waha'n naizo ko zamee'n par zalim..(2)<br> dafn jis jaa ali asghar hai, khuda khair kare</p> 
  <p>3. Kuch qadam door khadi dekh rahi hai zainab..(2)<br> shimr ke haath mein khanjar hai, khuda khair kare</p> 
  <p>4. Chauk kar khaak se kehti thi watan mein sughra..(2)<br> kisi mushkil mein mera ghar hai, khuda khair kare</p> 
  <p>5. Piche deewar hai aur jalta hua darr aage..(2)<br> bichme binte payambar hai, khuda khair kare</p> 
  <p>6. Berida jaana hai zainab ko waha'n par ke jaha'n..(2)<br> har koi dushman e haider hai, khuda khair kare</p> 
